      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PEAKY COLLINDA (4) flew the lids with a fast early split and led until late but gathered in when a 1.5 lengths second at this track over 525m in 30.49. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Capable of going well again. IVORY MIHARA (6) made light work of the tricky draw with a strong early sectional but swamped late when a close up fifth (28.52) at Bendigo over 500m. Better than last start and can bounce back. FRANKY'S OUTLAW (2) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (31.10) at this track behind Miss Jeckell in a Grade 5. Has the pace to be prominent. Must be included in calculations. ASTON EXCLUSIVE (8) is on a run of two wins and will be in the mix again.",
